#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_catalog import QiskitFunctionsCatalog\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog()\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_catalog import QiskitFunctionsCatalog\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog()\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Avoid executing code on an "
"untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize "
"security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example,"
" a public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on "
"the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce "
"risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API "
"keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"userapikey&interface=ui) topic. To initialize the service in this situation,"
" expand the following section to view code you can use:\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Évite d'exécuter du code sur une "
"machine non fiable ou dans un environnement Python cloud externe pour "
"minimiser les risques de sécurité.** Si tu dois utiliser un environnement "
"non fiable (par exemple, sur un ordinateur public), change ta clé API après "
"chaque utilisation en la supprimant sur la page [Clés API IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) pour réduire le risque. En savoir "
"plus dans la rubrique [Gestion des clés API "
"utilisateur](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"userapikey&interface=ui). Pour initialiser le service dans cette situation, "
"développe la section suivante pour voir le code que tu peux utiliser :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"        <AccordionItem title=\"Initialize the service in an untrusted environment\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"        <AccordionItem title=\"Initialize the service in an untrusted environment\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # After using the following code, delete your API key on the IBM Quantum Platform home dashboard\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog(token=\"<YOUR_API_KEY>\") # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"      </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protect your API key!** Never include your key in source code, Python script, or notebook file. When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the key and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"    # After using the following code, delete your API key on the IBM Quantum Platform home dashboard\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog(token=\"<YOUR_API_KEY>\") # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"      </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protège ta clé API !** N'inclus jamais ta clé dans le code source, un script Python ou un fichier notebook. Lorsque tu partages du code avec d'autres personnes, assure-toi que ta clé API n'est pas intégrée directement dans le script Python. Partage plutôt le script sans la clé et fournis des instructions pour la configurer de manière sécurisée.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
"4. After you have authenticated, you can list the functions from the Qiskit Functions Catalog that you have access to:\n"
msgstr ""
"      Si tu as accidentellement partagé ta clé avec quelqu'un ou si tu l'as incluse dans un système de contrôle de version comme Git, révoque immédiatement ta clé en la supprimant sur la page [Clés API IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) pour réduire le risque. En savoir plus dans la rubrique [Gestion des clés API utilisateur](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
"4. Après authentification, tu peux lister les fonctions du catalogue de fonctions Qiskit auxquelles tu as accès :\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run enabled functions {#run-enabled-functions}"
msgstr "Exécuter les fonctions activées {#run-enabled-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After a catalog object has been instantiated, you can select a function "
"using `catalog.load(provider/function-name)`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Une fois qu'un objet catalog a été instancié, tu peux sélectionner une "
"fonction avec `catalog.load(provider/function-name)` :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each Qiskit Function has custom inputs, options, and outputs. Check the "
"specific documentation pages for the function you want to run for more "
"information. By default, all users can only run one function job at a "
"time:\n"
msgstr ""
"Chaque fonction Qiskit possède des entrées, options et sorties "
"personnalisées. Consulte les pages de documentation spécifiques à la "
"fonction que tu souhaites exécuter pour plus d'informations. Par défaut, "
"tous les utilisateurs ne peuvent exécuter qu'un seul job de fonction à la "
"fois :\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Vérifier le statut du job {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Function workload's current status.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Actuellement, le tableau des charges de travail IBM Quantum ne reflète que les charges de travail Qiskit Runtime. Utilise `job.status()` pour voir le statut actuel de ta charge de travail de fonction Qiskit.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With your Qiskit Function `job_id`, you can check the status of running "
"jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr ""
"Avec l'`job_id` de ta fonction Qiskit, tu peux vérifier le statut des jobs "
"en cours d'exécution. Voici les statuts possibles :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Function queue. The queue "
"priority is based on how much you've used Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`QUEUED`** : Le programme distant est dans la file d'attente de la "
"fonction Qiskit. La priorité de la file est basée sur ton utilisation des "
"fonctions Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up"
" the remote environment and installing dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`INITIALIZING`** : Le programme distant démarre ; cela inclut la "
"configuration de l'environnement distant et l'installation des "
"dépendances.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. This also includes several more "
"detailed statuses if supported by specific functions\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING`** : Le programme est en cours d'exécution. Cela inclut également"
" plusieurs statuts plus détaillés si pris en charge par des fonctions "
"spécifiques :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**\": The function is currently mapping your classical "
"inputs to quantum inputs\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: MAPPING`** : La fonction est en train de mapper tes entrées "
"classiques vers des entrées quantiques.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**\": The function is optimizing for the"
" selected QPU. This could include circuit transpilation, QPU "
"characterization, observable backpropagation, and so forth\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`** : La fonction optimise pour le QPU "
"sélectionné. Cela peut inclure la transpilation de circuits, la "
"caractérisation du QPU, la rétropropagation d'observables, etc.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: The function has submitted a job to Qiskit "
"Runtime, and is waiting in the queue\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`** : La fonction a soumis un job à Qiskit "
"Runtime et attend dans la file.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: The function has an active Qiskit Runtime "
"job\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`** : La fonction a un job Qiskit Runtime actif.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: The function is post-processing results. "
"This could include error mitigation, mapping quantum results to classical, "
"and so forth\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`** : La fonction est en train de post-traiter "
"les résultats. Cela peut inclure la mitigation d'erreurs, le mapping des "
"résultats quantiques vers le classique, etc.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve result data with "
"`job.results()`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`DONE`** : Le programme est terminé et tu peux récupérer les données de "
"résultat avec `job.results()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`ERROR`**: The program stopped running because of a problem. Use "
"`job.result()` to get the error message.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`ERROR`** : Le programme s'est arrêté en raison d'un problème. Utilise "
"`job.result()` pour obtenir le message d'erreur.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`CANCELED`**: The program was canceled; either by a user, the service, or "
"the server.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`CANCELED`** : Le programme a été annulé ; soit par un utilisateur, le "
"service ou le serveur.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results {#retrieve-results}"
msgstr "Récupérer les résultats {#retrieve-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result. "
"This output format varies with each function, so be sure to follow the "
"specific documentation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Une fois qu'un programme est en statut `DONE`, tu peux utiliser "
"`job.results()` pour récupérer le résultat. Ce format de sortie varie selon "
"chaque fonction, alors assure-toi de consulter la documentation spécifique "
":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can also cancel a job at any time:\n"
msgstr "Tu peux également annuler un job à tout moment :\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List previously run jobs run with Qiskit Functions {#list-previously-run-"
"jobs-run-with-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr ""
"Lister les jobs précédemment exécutés avec les fonctions Qiskit {#list-"
"previously-run-jobs-run-with-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Functions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux utiliser `jobs()` pour lister tous les jobs soumis aux fonctions "
"Qiskit :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you already have the job ID for a certain job, you can retrieve the job "
"with `catalog.get_job_by_id()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Si tu as déjà l'ID d'un certain job, tu peux le récupérer avec "
"`catalog.get_job_by_id()` :\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Récupérer les messages d'erreur {#fetch-error-messages}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a program status is `ERROR`, use `job.error_message()` to fetch the error"
" message as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Si le statut d'un programme est `ERROR`, utilise `job.error_message()` pour "
"récupérer le message d'erreur comme suit :\n"

